{"unit_id":"Dobo233__dsh-codex-pilot#card-zh","repo":"Dobo233/dsh-codex-pilot","commit":"0f6e4f12aa909588eeca08e7b0cd69546049b495","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-pilot 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的开发工具插件，将本机 Codex CLI 注册为可调用工具。它提供 codex_run 执行独立任务、codex_resume 续接已有会话、codex_queue 向运行中的会话投递消息，以及 codex_probe 检查 CLI 版本和子命令。插件通过启动本地 Codex 子进程并返回其输出工作，适合希望让 DSH agent 委派编码任务或继续处理 Codex 会话的用户；还可单独运行桥接程序，通过回环 HTTP 和文件信箱提交任务。使用前需要安装并能在本机找到 Codex CLI，可通过配置指定可执行文件和工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-294","standalone/bridge.cjs:312-386"]}
{"unit_id":"Dobo233__dsh-codex-pilot#card-en","repo":"Dobo233/dsh-codex-pilot","commit":"0f6e4f12aa909588eeca08e7b0cd69546049b495","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-codex-pilot connects the local Codex CLI to DSH as tools for running a task, resuming a session, queuing a message, and checking CLI availability. A standalone bridge also accepts requests over loopback HTTP or a file mailbox. It requires a local Codex CLI installation.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:175-294","standalone/bridge.cjs:312-386"]}
